{"type":"message","id":"2ddefaec","parentId":"16010b56","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:40:00.896Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.exec:1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_t=1778821929480&amp;r=02d5n0\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 05:12:10 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n      <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Gemini reports 42% revenue growth after expansion into financial services</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 04:24:56 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 15 May 2026 04:24:56 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/gemini-reports-42-revenue-growth-expansion-financial-services</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/gemini-reports-42-revenue-growth-expansion-financial-services?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtY3J5cHRvLWluZHVzdHJ5LW5lZWRzLWEtY3J5cHRvLWNhcGl0YWwtbWFya2V0LXN0cnVjdHVyZS1nZW1pbmkuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Gemini reports 42% revenue growth after expansion into financial services\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Gemini credit card revenue surged nearly 300% to $14.7 million in Q1, attributed to significant growth in its user base. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtY3J5cHRvLWluZHVzdHJ5LW5lZWRzLWEtY3J5cHRvLWNhcGl0YWwtbWFya2V0LXN0cnVjdHVyZS1nZW1pbmkuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtY3J5cHRvLWluZHVzdHJ5LW5lZWRzLWEtY3J5cHRvLWNhcGl0YWwtbWFya2V0LXN0cnVjdHVyZS1nZW1pbmkuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto data company Dune cuts 25% of staff in restructuring</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 04:04:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 15 May 2026 04:04:18 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-data-company-dune-cuts-25-of-staff-ai-use-grows</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-data-company-dune-cuts-25-of-staff-ai-use-grows?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sYXlvZmZzLW1pZ2h0LWJlLWEtc2lnbi1vZi10aGUtbWFya2V0LW1hdHVyaW5nbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto data company Dune cuts 25% of staff in restructuring\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Dune co-founder and CEO Fredrik Haga says the company’s staff cuts come as it shifts focus and is “all-in” on AI and institutional interest in crypto.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sYXlvZmZzLW1pZ2h0LWJlLWEtc2lnbi1vZi10aGUtbWFya2V0LW1hdHVyaW5nbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sYXlvZmZzLW1pZ2h0LWJlLWEtc2lnbi1vZi10aGUtbWFya2V0LW1hdHVyaW5nbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Strive rallies 5.8% as it clears debt in Q1, unveils daily dividends</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 02:34:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 15 May 2026 02:34:46 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/strive-rallies-5-percent-daily-dividends-clearing-all-debt-q1</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/strive-rallies-5-percent-daily-dividends-clearing-all-debt-q1?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1jcnlwdG8tcHVtcC1hbmQtZHVtcC1ncm91cHMtYXJlLXRoZXktbGVnYWwuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Strive rallies 5.8% as it clears debt in Q1, unveils daily dividends\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Strive reported a net loss of $265.9 million for Q1, which it attributed to the fall in market value of its Bitcoin holdings, but saw its shares on its move to pay SATA holders dividends every business day starting in June. \n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1jcnlwdG8tcHVtcC1hbmQtZHVtcC1ncm91cHMtYXJlLXRoZXktbGVnYWwuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1jcnlwdG8tcHVtcC1hbmQtZHVtcC1ncm91cHMtYXJlLXRoZXktbGVnYWwuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title> UK politician Nigel Farage bought $1.8M house after a $6.7M crypto gift</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:32:33 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:32:33 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/nigel-farage-house-crypto-gift</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/nigel-farage-house-crypto-gift?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aXRsZS10b2tlbi1mb3ItYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1lc3RhdGUtcmVnaXN0cnktcGFydC0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\" UK politician Nigel Farage bought $1.8M house after a $6.7M crypto gift\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The news follows growing calls from UK lawmakers and government officials to curb or temporarily ban crypto political donations in the country.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aXRsZS10b2tlbi1mb3ItYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1lc3RhdGUtcmVnaXN0cnktcGFydC0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aXRsZS10b2tlbi1mb3ItYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1lc3RhdGUtcmVnaXN0cnktcGFydC0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Dartmouth endowment invests in Solana ETF, holds $14M in crypto exposure</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:04:12 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:04:12 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/dartmouth-endowment-crypto-investments-sec</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/dartmouth-endowment-crypto-investments-sec?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbm5vdmF0aW9uLWluLWZpYXQtb24tcmFtcHMtY2FuLW92ZXJjb21lLWNyeXB0b3MtZXhwZW5zaXZlLWNhcmQtZmVlcy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Dartmouth endowment invests in Solana ETF, holds $14M in crypto exposure\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The unversity’s endowment disclosed holdings in the Bitwise Solana staking ETF, Grayscale Ethereum staking ETF and BlackRock’s iShares Bitcoin ETF.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbm5vdmF0aW9uLWluLWZpYXQtb24tcmFtcHMtY2FuLW92ZXJjb21lLWNyeXB0b3MtZXhwZW5zaXZlLWNhcmQtZmVlcy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbm5vdmF0aW9uLWluLWZpYXQtb24tcmFtcHMtY2FuLW92ZXJjb21lLWNyeXB0b3MtZXhwZW5zaXZlLWNhcmQtZmVlcy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Ex-Celsius exec sentenced to time served after guilty plea</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:46:55 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:46:55 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/celsius-roni-cohen-pavon-sentenced-guilty-plea</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/celsius-roni-cohen-pavon-sentenced-guilty-plea?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmlzb24yLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Ex-Celsius exec sentenced to time served after guilty plea\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Celsius‘ former chief revenue officer received a lenient sentence after his 2023 guilty plea for fraud and conspiracy to commit price manipulation.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmlzb24yLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmlzb24yLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin trades at a 'discount' on Coinbase: Is a $76K retest next?</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:42:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:42:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-trades-discount-coinbase-is-76k-retest-next</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-trades-discount-coinbase-is-76k-retest-next?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1yaXNrLXZzLXJld2FyZC1pbnZlc3RpbmctaW4tYml0Y29pbi1hdC1hbi1hbGwtdGltZS1oaWdoLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin trades at a 'discount' on Coinbase: Is a $76K retest next?\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin’s $79,000 defense proves that the Coinbase discount is driven by stablecoin volatility rather than a lack of institutional demand.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Marcel Pechman</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1yaXNrLXZzLXJld2FyZC1pbnZlc3RpbmctaW4tYml0Y29pbi1hdC1hbi1hbGwtdGltZS1oaWdoLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1yaXNrLXZzLXJld2FyZC1pbnZlc3RpbmctaW4tYml0Y29pbi1hdC1hbi1hbGwtdGltZS1oaWdoLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto losses from North Korea hackers in 2025 rose 51% YoY: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:01:17 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:01:17 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/losses-dprk-hacks-2025-rose-51-year-over-year</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/losses-dprk-hacks-2025-rose-51-year-over-year?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctMzEtbm9ydGgta29yZWFuLWRldmVsb3BlcnMtZm9vbGVkLXRvcC1jcnlwdG8tY29tcGFuaWVzLWFuZC1zdG9sZS02ODBrLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto losses from North Korea hackers in 2025 rose 51% YoY: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The cybersecurity threats from North Korea are perpetrated by a myriad of small hacker groups deploying malware and executing social engineering scams.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctMzEtbm9ydGgta29yZWFuLWRldmVsb3BlcnMtZm9vbGVkLXRvcC1jcnlwdG8tY29tcGFuaWVzLWFuZC1zdG9sZS02ODBrLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctMzEtbm9ydGgta29yZWFuLWRldmVsb3BlcnMtZm9vbGVkLXRvcC1jcnlwdG8tY29tcGFuaWVzLWFuZC1zdG9sZS02ODBrLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US Senate Banking Committee votes to advance CLARITY Act</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:18:01 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:18:01 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senate-banking-committee-advance-clarity-act</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://coin