arity-act</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senate-banking-committee-advance-clarity-act?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaW5ldy11cy1nb3Zlcm5tZW50Mi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"US Senate Banking Committee votes to advance CLARITY Act\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Lawmakers debated amendments on ethics and other issues for a digital asset market structure bill before advancing the legislation, setting up a Senate floor vote.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaW5ldy11cy1nb3Zlcm5tZW50Mi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaW5ldy11cy1nb3Zlcm5tZW50Mi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>XRP whale wallets hit all-time highs: Will it push price above $1.50?</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:41:36 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:41:36 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/xrp-whale-wallets-all-time-highs-will-it-push-price-above-1-50</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/xrp-whale-wallets-all-time-highs-will-it-push-price-above-1-50?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbW