lly</category>\n      <category>Bitcoin</category>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Who supports CLARITY on the US Senate Banking Committee? </title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:22:34 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:22:34 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/features/who-supports-clarity-act-senate-banking-committee</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/features/who-supports-clarity-act-senate-banking-committee?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iZXR0ZXIta25vdy1hLWNyeXB0by1jYW5kaWRhdGUuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Who supports CLARITY on the US Senate Banking Committee? \" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The US Senate banking committee will hold a markup session on May 14 for the CLARITY Act, and support appears at least nominally bipartisan.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Aaron Wood</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iZXR0ZXIta25vdy1hLWNyeXB0by1jYW5kaWRhdGUuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iZXR0ZXIta25vdy1hLWNyeXB0by1jYW5kaWRhdGUuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Features</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>What's preventing Bitcoin price from breaking above $80K? </title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:18:05 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:18:05 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/whats-preventing-bitcoin-price-from-breaking-above-80k</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/whats-preventing-bitcoin-price-from-breaking-above-80k?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2lucy1oaWRkZW4tbWVzc2FnZXMtYml0Y29pbi1wcmljZS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"What's preventing Bitcoin price from breaking above $80K? \" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin struggles to regain its footing above $80,000 as some buyers remain hesitant and heavy resistance builds overhead. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Biraajmaan Tamuly</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2lucy1oaWRkZW4tbWVzc2FnZXMtYml0Y29pbi1wcmljZS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2lucy1oaWRkZW4tbWVzc2FnZXMtYml0Y29pbi1wcmljZS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Clawville unleashes the first AI-native open world MMORPG into the Milady Ecosystem</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:07:26 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:07:26 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/clawville-unleashes-the-first-ai-native-open-world-mmorpg-into-the-milady-ecosystem</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/clawville-unleashes-the-first-ai-native-open-world-mmorpg-into-the-milady-ecosystem?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wci05LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Clawville unleashes the first AI-native open world MMORPG into the Milady Ecosystem\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The next major evolution of gaming may come from a rapidly growing digital universe where AI agents and humans coexist, compete, collaborate, learn, earn, and evolve together in real time.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Advertorial</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wci05LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wci05LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Press Releases</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Wall Street’s tokenization boom has a liquidity problem: Axis CEO</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:22:33 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:22:33 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/features/wall-street-tokenization-boom-liquidity-problem-axis-ceo</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/features/wall-street-tokenization-boom-liquidity-problem-axis-ceo?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWEtbGlxdWlkaXR5LWNyaXNpcy1hbmQtd2hhdC1kb2VzLWl0LW1lYW4tZm9yLWNyeXB0by1pbnZlc3RvcnMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Wall Street’s tokenization boom has a liquidity problem: Axis CEO\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>As RWAs cross $32 billion and JPMorgan files for a new tokenized fund, Axis CEO Chris Kim argues that the industry is celebrating the wrong milestone.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yohan Yun</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWEtbGlxdWlkaXR5LWNyaXNpcy1hbmQtd2hhdC1kb2VzLWl0LW1lYW4tZm9yLWNyeXB0by1pbnZlc3RvcnMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWEtbGlxdWlkaXR5LWNyaXNpcy1hbmQtd2hhdC1kb2VzLWl0LW1lYW4tZm9yLWNyeXB0by1pbnZlc3RvcnMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Features</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin ETFs bleed $635M as BTC slips under $80K</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:14:17 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:14:17 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-funds-635-million-outflows-btc-dips-back-under-80k</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-funds-635-million-outflows-btc-dips-back-under-80k?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1pbmZsb3dzLWFuZC1vdXRmbG93cy1vbi1jcnlwdG8tZXhjaGFuZ2VzLWJpdGNvaW4tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin ETFs bleed $635M as BTC slips under $80K\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin ETFs saw $635 million in outflows on Wednesday, the largest since late January, as BlackRock’s IBIT led redemptions amid profit-taking and BTC swings near $80,000.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Helen Partz</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1pbmZsb3dzLWFuZC1vdXRmbG93cy1vbi1jcnlwdG8tZXhjaGFuZ2VzLWJpdGNvaW4tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWFyZS1pbmZsb3dzLWFuZC1vdXRmbG93cy1vbi1jcnlwdG8tZXhjaGFuZ2VzLWJpdGNvaW4tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Tether’s T3 Crime Unit says it has frozen $450M in suspected illicit crypto</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/tethers-t3-crime-unit-frozen-450m-in-suspected-illicit-crypto</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/tethers-t3-crime-unit-frozen-450m-in-suspected-illicit-crypto?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hbWlkLWNyeXB0by13aW50ZXItY2JkY3MtY29udGludWUtdG8tbG9zZS1zdXBwb3J0LWZyb20tY2VudHJhbC1iYW5rcy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Tether’s T3 Crime Unit says it has frozen $450M in suspected illicit crypto\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>T3 Financial Crime Unit says it has frozen over $450 million tied to suspected illicit activity as stablecoin compliance pressures intensify.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hbWlkLWNyeXB0by13aW50ZXItY2JkY3MtY29udGludWUtdG8tbG9zZS1zdXBwb3J0LWZyb20tY2VudHJhbC1iYW5rcy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hbWlkLWNyeXB0by13aW50ZXItY2JkY3MtY29udGludWUtdG8tbG9zZS1zdXBwb3J0LWZyb20tY2VudHJhbC1iYW5rcy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Analysts are watching these Bitcoin price levels ahead of CLARITY Act vote</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 12:14:53 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 12:14:53 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/analysts-these-bitcoin-price-levels-ahead-clarity-act-vote</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/analysts-these-bitcoin-price-levels-ahead-clarity-act-vote?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXZlLWJpdGNvaW4tbmFycmF0aXZlcy1hbmFseXN0cy1hcmUtd2F0Y2hpbmctYmV5b25kLXByaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Analysts are watching these Bitcoin price levels ahead of CLARITY Act vote\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin price traded below $80,000 as investors braced for the US Senate CLARITY Act markup vote that could see sudden swings toward key BTC price levels.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Nancy Lubale</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXZlLWJpdGNvaW4tbmFycmF0aXZlcy1hbmFseXN0cy1hcmUtd2F0Y2hpbmctYmV5b25kLXByaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXZlLWJpdGNvaW4tbmFycmF0aXZlcy1hbmFseXN0cy1hcmUtd2F0Y2hpbmctYmV5b25kLXByaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Law firm Fenwick & West sued for $525M over alleged role in FTX collapse]]></title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 11:27:23 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 11:27:23 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-sued-for-525m-over-alleged-role-in-ftx-collapse</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-sued-for-525m-over-alleged-role-in-ftx-collapse?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uby1uYW1lMjM1LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Law firm Fenwick & West sued for $525M over alleged role in FTX collapse\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Twenty FTX victims are suing Fenwick & West, claiming the law firm didn’t just represent FTX, it helped build the infrastructure that kept the fraud running.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uby1uYW1lMjM1LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uby1uYW1lMjM1LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>JPMorgan lifts Bitcoin ETF exposure in Q1, led by BlackRock’s IBIT</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 11:22:22 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 11:22:22 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-bitcoin-etf-buy-blackrock-ibit-q1-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-bitcoin-etf-buy-blackrock-ibit-q1-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1pcy1ub3ctc3VwZXJpb3Itb3Zlci1kb2xsYXItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"JPMorgan lifts Bitcoin ETF exposure in Q1, led by BlackRock’s IBIT\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The bank raised its reported IBIT holdings by 174% in the first quarter while also adding exposure to select Bitcoin, Ether and Solana-linked funds.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Helen Partz</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1pcy1ub3ctc3VwZXJpb3Itb3Zlci1kb2xsYXItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1pcy1ub3ctc3VwZXJpb3Itb3Zlci1kb2xsYXItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Altcoin season ‘quietly’ starting? Analysts spot three bullish indicators</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:25:56 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:25:56 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/altcoin-quietly-starting-analysts-spot-three-bullish-indicators</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/altcoin-quietly-starting-analysts-spot-three-bullish-indicators?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbHRjb2lucy1tYXktMTMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Altcoin season ‘quietly’ starting? Analysts spot three bullish indicators\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Crypto analysts spot early altcoin recovery signals as key metrics improve and capital rotation hints at a potential altseason in 2026.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Nancy Lubale</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbHRjb2lucy1tYXktMTMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbHRjb2lucy1tYXktMTMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>CFTC no-action letter eases event contract reporting rules</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:24:47 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:24:47 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-issues-no-action-letter-prediction-market-data-reporting</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-issues-no-action-letter-prediction-market-data-reporting?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXBlci1kb2N1bWVudC1tYW4tb2ZmaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"CFTC no-action letter eases event contract reporting rules\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The CFTC issued no-action relief from certain swap reporting rules for fully collateralized event contracts as prediction market disputes widen.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Zoltan Vardai</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXBlci1kb2N1bWVudC1tYW4tb2ZmaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXBlci1kb2N1bWVudC1tYW4tb2ZmaWNlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bank of England reconsiders strict stablecoin regime</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:12:43 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:12:43 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/boe-signals-softer-uk-stablecoin-regime-after-industry-backlash</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/boe-signals-softer-uk-stablecoin-regime-after-industry-backlash?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iYW5rLW9sZC1uZXctY3J5cHRvLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bank of England reconsiders strict stablecoin regime\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>BoE weighs easing UK stablecoin caps and reserve demands after industry backlash, in a move that could decide whether GBP tokens can compete with dollar‑pegged rivals.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iYW5rLW9sZC1uZXctY3J5cHRvLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iYW5rLW9sZC1uZXctY3J5cHRvLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>BitGo posts wider Q1 loss despite revenue more than doubling</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 09:15:12 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 09:15:12 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitgo-posts-38b-in-revenue-but-losses-double-amid-bitcoin-decline-ipo-costs</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitgo-posts-38b-in-revenue-but-losses-double-amid-bitcoin-decline-ipo-costs?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1zcG9uc29yZWQtYXJ0aWNsZS1vZi1mdHguanBn.jpg\" alt=\"BitGo posts wider Q1 loss despite revenue more than doubling\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>BitGo’s headline revenue figure doubled year-over-year to $3.8 billion, but a Bitcoin price decline and IPO-related costs pushed net losses to $60.7 million in the first quarter.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1zcG9uc29yZWQtYXJ0aWNsZS1vZi1mdHguanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1zcG9uc29yZWQtYXJ0aWNsZS1vZi1mdHguanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Trump’s White House weighs 250 pardons to celebrate America's 250th birthday </title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:26:11 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:26:11 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-weighs-250-pardons-as-crypto-founders-seek-clemency</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-weighs-250-pardons-as-crypto-founders-seek-clemency?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy93aGl0ZS1ob3VzZS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Trump’s White House weighs 250 pardons to celebrate America's 250th birthday \" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>One of the developers behind the crypto-mixing protocol Samourai Wallet has publicly expressed hopes for a pardon, along with FTX founder Sam Bankman-Fried.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy93aGl0ZS1ob3VzZS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy93aGl0ZS1ob3VzZS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>NY judge pushes back hearing for Aave’s bid to unfreeze $71M in ETH</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:16:05 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:16:05 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/judge-delays-aaves-emergency-bid-to-unfreeze-71m-hacked-crypto</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/judge-delays-aaves-emergency-bid-to-unfreeze-71m-hacked-crypto?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtYWZ0ZXJtYXRoLW9mLWxicnktY29uc2VxdWVuY2VzLW9mLWNyeXB0b3Mtb25nb2luZy1yZWd1bGF0b3J5LXByb2Nlc3MuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"NY judge pushes back hearing for Aave’s bid to unfreeze $71M in ETH\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>A New York judge has ordered supplemental briefings because Aave did not adequately outline how compounding losses could occur if the restraining notice remains in place.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brian Quarmby</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtYWZ0ZXJtYXRoLW9mLWxicnktY29uc2VxdWVuY2VzLW9mLWNyeXB0b3Mtb25nb2luZy1yZWd1bGF0b3J5LXByb2Nlc3MuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtYWZ0ZXJtYXRoLW9mLWxicnktY29uc2VxdWVuY2VzLW9mLWNyeXB0b3Mtb25nb2luZy1yZWd1bGF0b3J5LXByb2Nlc3MuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin firm Nakamoto records net loss in Q1 despite sixfold revenue growth</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:02:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:02:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-treasury-nakamoto-reports-238m-net-loss-q1</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-treasury-nakamoto-reports-238m-net-loss-q1?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy90cmFkaW5nLXdoaXRlLWRvd24tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin firm Nakamoto records net loss in Q1 despite sixfold revenue growth\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Nakamoto CEO David Bailey said the company is focused on scaling its Bitcoin treasury, services and trading strategies for the remainder of 2026.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy90cmFkaW5nLXdoaXRlLWRvd24tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy90cmFkaW5nLXdoaXRlLWRvd24tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778823600895}}
{"type":"message","id":"c3af9447","parentId":"2ddefaec","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:40:00.896Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.exec:2","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:43:50 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Pushes New ChatGPT Safety Features as Lawsuits Mount</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367937/openai-new-chatgpt-safety-features-lawsuits-investigations</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:43:50 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI says ChatGPT can better detect signs of self-harm and violence as the company faces lawsuits and investigations over dangerous chatbot interactions.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367937</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Apple Mac M5 System Exploited With Anthropic&#39;s Claude Mythos AI, Researchers Claim</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367925/apple-mac-m5-system-exploited-anthropic-claude-mythos-ai</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:16:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Security startup Calif says researchers used a preview version of Anthropic&#39;s Claude Mythos AI to help build an Apple macOS kernel exploit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367925</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>NFL All Day Stops Issuing NFTs as Dapper Labs Signals Future Plans With League</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367926/nfl-all-day-stops-issuing-nfts-dapper-labs-future-plans-league</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 21:04:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Dapper Labs said it has signed a new licensing agreement with the NFL as it discontinues the release of NFTs on its All Day platform.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367926</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-nfl-football-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>NFTs</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-nfl-football-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Firm Strive Unveils Daily Dividend Payments for SATA Preferred Shares</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367878/bitcoin-firm-strive-daily-dividend-payments-preferred-share</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:53:51 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Strategy&#39;s Michael Saylor called Strive&#39;s impending shift to daily dividend payments &#34;impressive.&#34;</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367878</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-strive-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-strive-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Kimi WebBridge Lets AI Agents Drive Your Browser—And Keep Your Data Local</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367916/kimi-webbridge-ai-agents-browser-local</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:49:37 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Moonshot AI just shipped a browser extension that hands the wheel to AI agents. It clicks, scrolls, fills forms, and navigates your Chrome or Edge—without sessions ever leaving your machine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367916</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>ChatGPT Is Losing Ground to Rivals—Here Are Some Numbers</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367884/chatgpt-losing-ground-anthrophic-google-numbers</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:44:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>ChatGPT&#39;s web traffic share is falling while its rivals are rising—just as businesses start to look beyond OpenAI.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367884</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-ai-chatgpt-gemini-claude-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-ai-chatgpt-gemini-claude-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Confirms Security Breach Linked to AI Malware Campaign</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367883/openai-confirms-security-breach-ai-malware-campaign</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:30:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI says malware tied to the Shai-Hulud supply chain attack accessed internal repositories after infecting two employee devices.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367883</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Kraken to Migrate Wrapped Bitcoin Tech to Chainlink as LayerZero Exodus Expands</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367880/kraken-migrate-wrapped-bitcoin-chainlink-layerzero-exodus</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:09:49 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Crypto exchange Kraken is the latest firm to shift away from LayerZero tech following last month&#39;s $292 million Kelp DAO exploit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367880</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>AI Agents May Complete Dangerous Tasks Without Understanding the Consequences: Study</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367869/ai-agents-dangerous-tasks-without-understanding-consequences</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 17:32:31 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Researchers found that AI agents designed to automate tasks often pursue them without recognizing when their actions are dangerous.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367869</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-05-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-05-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tether, Tron and TRM Financial Crime Unit Has Frozen $450 Million in Illicit Crypto Funds</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367874/tether-tron-trm-financial-crime-unit-frozen-450-million-crypto-funds</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 17:16:12 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A public-private partnership among Tether, Tron, and TRM Labs is expanding its global reach, working with law enforcement in 23 countries.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367874</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"998\" width=\"1775\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Democrats Split on Clarity Act as Crypto Bill Passes Key Senate Committee Vote</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367871/democrats-split-clarity-act-crypto-bill-passes-senate-committee-vote</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:51:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The landmark crypto bill now passes onto the Senate floor for final approval, though many hurdles remain.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367871</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bullish Shares Dip on Earnings Miss, $605 Million Loss as Value of Crypto Holdings Fell</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367857/bullish-shares-dip-earnings-miss-605-million-loss</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 15:42:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bullish shares fell Thursday after the company reported a first-quarter loss alongside disappointing subscriptions and services revenue.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367857</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>CFTC No-Action Letter on Prediction Markets Streamlines Swap Data Reporting</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367858/cftc-no-action-letter-on-prediction-markets-streamlines-swap-data-reporting</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 15:33:29 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The regulatory relief streamlines compliance for prediction market operators dealing with event contract data reporting requirements.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367858</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>polygon</category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Firm Nakamoto&#39;s Stock Hits New Low After Posting $239M Loss, Selling More BTC</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367854/bitcoin-firm-nakamoto-stock-new-low-239-million-loss-selling-btc</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 15:09:28 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Shares in Bitcoin treasury firm Nakamoto hit a new all-time low Thursday after it posted a $239 million loss and sold more BTC in Q1.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367854</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-24-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-24-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>[... 23799 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":580,"aggregated":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>