4 May 2026 18:44:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>ChatGPT&#39;s web traffic share is falling while its rivals are rising—just as businesses start to look beyond OpenAI.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367884</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-ai-chatgpt-gemini-claude-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-ai-chatgpt-gemini-claude-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Confirms Security Breach Linked to AI Malware Campaign</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367883/openai-confirms-security-breach-ai-malware-campaign</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:30:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI says malware tied to the Shai-Hulud supply chain attack accessed internal repositories after infecting two employee devices.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367883</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Kraken to Migrate Wrapped Bitcoin Tech to Chainlink as LayerZero Exodus Expands</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367880/kraken-migrate-wrapped-bitcoin-chainlink-layerzero-exodus</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 18:09:49 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Crypto exchange Kraken is the latest firm to shift away from LayerZero tech following last month&#39;s $292 million Kelp DAO exploit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367880</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/kraken-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>AI Agents May Complete Dangerous Tasks Without Understanding the Consequences: Study</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367869/ai-agents-dangerous-tasks-without-understanding-consequences</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 17:32:31 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Researchers found that AI agents designed to automate tasks often pursue them without recognizing when their actions are dangerous.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367869</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-05-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-05-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tether, Tron and TRM Financial Crime Unit Has Frozen $450 Million in Illicit Crypto Funds</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367874/tether-tron-trm-financial-crime-unit-frozen-450-million-crypto-funds</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 17:16:12 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A public-private partnership among Tether, Tron, and TRM Labs is expanding its global reach, working with law enforcement in 23 countries.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367874</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"998\" width=\"1775\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Democrats Split on Clarity Act as Crypto Bill Passes Key Senate Committee Vote</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367871/democrats-split-clarity-act-crypto-bill-passes-senate-committee-vote</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 16:51:58 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The landmark crypto bill now passes onto the Senate floor for final approval, though many hurdles remain.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367871</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cd