t contract data reporting requirements.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367858</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>polygon</category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Firm Nakamoto&#39;s Stock Hits New Low After Posting $239M Loss, Selling More BTC</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367854/bitcoin-firm-nakamoto-stock-new-low-239-million-loss-selling-btc</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 15:09:28 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Shares in Bitcoin treasury firm Nakamoto hit a new all-time low Thursday after it posted a $239 million loss and sold more BTC in Q1.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367854</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-24-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-24-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Reform UK&#39;s Nigel Farage Faces Standards Probe Over Tether Billionaire&#39;s $6.7 Million Gift</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367821/reform-uks-nigel-farage-faces-standards-probe-tether-billionaires-gift</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 14:25:26 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Parliamentary Standards Commissioner is examining Farage’s undisclosed £5 million gift from Tether investor Christopher Harborne.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Stephen Graves</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367821</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/nigel-farage-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/nigel-farage-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bank of England Softens ‘Overly Conservative’ Stablecoin Plans Amid Industry Pressure</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367831/bank-of-england-softens-overly-conservative-stablecoin-plans-amid-industry-pressure</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:10:39 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>BoE officials are reportedly reviewing caps and reserve rules as the UK tries to keep stablecoin issuers onshore.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vince Dioquino</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367831</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bank-of-england-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bank-of-england-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tezos Tests Post-Quantum Privacy as Founder Slams &#39;Half-Baked&#39; Bitcoin Quantum Theories</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367795/tezos-post-quantum-privacy-founder-slams-half-baked-bitcoin-theories</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 13:01:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Arthur Breitman&#39;s comments come as Tezos tests a post-quantum privacy system designed to protect encrypted blockchain data from future attacks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367795</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/quantum-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>tezos</category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/quantum-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin’s Dip Below $80K Could Be ‘Short-Lived’ as STRC Cycle Looms</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367828/bitcoins-dip-below-80k-could-be-short-lived-as-strc-cycle-looms</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 12:49:20 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Strategy&#39;s STRC stock has fueled mid-month Bitcoin rallies since March, but May demand is plateauing as ETFs posted $630 million outflows.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367828</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-21-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-21-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: What’s At Stake with Trump in Beijing</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367825/morning-minute-whats-at-stake-with-trump-in-beijing</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 11:57:13 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Trump&#39;s in Beijing for the biggest potential market-moving event of the year, while Claude helped one lucky user recover $400,000 in Bitcoin.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367825</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/China-USA-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/China-USA-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"899\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin ETFs Shed $630M in Largest Daily Exit Since January</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367822/bitcoin-etfs-shed-630m-in-largest-daily-exit-since-january</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 10:56:18 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Inflation fears and Fed uncertainty trigger the biggest U.S. Bitcoin ETF outflows since January, snapping weeks of institutional inflows.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vismaya V</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367822</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bitcoin-etf-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bitcoin-etf-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Owner Claims Claude AI Cracked Lost Wallet Password, Netting $400K in BTC</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367796/claude-ai-cracked-lost-bitcoin-wallet-owner-claims</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 22:06:29 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A viral thread on X drew millions of views as a user claimed Claude AI helped recover a lost Bitcoin wallet.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367796</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-19-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-19-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Rally Cut Short as Profit-Taking Rises, US Demand Falls: CryptoQuant</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367787/bitcoin-rally-cut-short-profit-taking-rises-us-demand-falls-cryptoquant</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 21:30:46 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin&#39;s recent rally stalled at a critical level, putting the top crypto asset in a position that has previously led to major downturns.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367787</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-23-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-23-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Myriad Adopts Chainlink as Official Oracle Platform to Power New Crypto Prediction Markets</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367581/myriad-adopts-chainlink-as-official-oracle-platform-to-power-new-crypto-prediction-markets</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 19:56:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Chainlink Runtime Environment enables Myriad to deploy a new range of prediction markets with immediate settlement.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Staff</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367581</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Our Company</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-1-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto-Friendly Kevin Warsh Confirmed as Fed Chair to Replace Jerome Powell</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367784/crypto-friendly-kevin-warsh-confirmed-fed-chair-replace-jerome-powell</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 19:40:07 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Kevin Warsh, President Donald Trump&#39;s pick to lead the Federal Reserve, was confirmed as its new chair Wednesday to replace Jerome Powell.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367784</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/federal-reserve-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/federal-reserve-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Senators File Clarity Act Amendments on DeFi, Trump Family, and Jeffrey Epstein</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367781/clarity-act-amendments-defi-trump-family-jeffrey-epstein</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 19:35:48 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Senate Banking Committee will vote tomorrow on the new additions to the crypto bill, before deciding whether to refer it to the Senate floor.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367781</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Firm Metaplanet Posts $725 Million Loss, Delays Preferred Share Offerings</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367770/bitcoin-firm-metaplanet-725-million-loss-delays-preferred-share</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 17:33:52 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Metaplanet CEO Simon Gerovich acknowledged that preferred shares unveiled in November have yet to be issued.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367770</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-yen-decrypt-style-new-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-yen-decrypt-style-new-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>UK Treasury: Digital Assets Have Potential for &#39;Complete Transformation&#39; of Markets</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367773/uk-treasury-digital-assets-have-potential-for-complete-transformation-of-markets</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 17:26:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Economic Secretary to the Treasury highlighted an upcoming consultation on payments encompassing digital assets and AI agents.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Stephen Graves</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367773</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/hm-treasury-uk-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/hm-treasury-uk-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"719\" width=\"1278\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>&#39;Lord of the Rings&#39; Director Peter Jackson Says AI Is &#39;Just a Special Effect&#39;</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367759/lord-rings-director-peter-jackson-ai-just-special-effect</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 17:06:51 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Peter Jackson says Hollywood’s fears around AI could hurt recognition for performance-capture acting, as debates about how the technology will reshape the movie industry grow.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367759</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/peter-jackson-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/peter-jackson-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>How Figure is Democratizing Crypto-as-Collateral for Mainstream Users</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366771/how-figure-is-democratizing-crypto-as-collateral-for-mainstream-users</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 17:01:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>As digital assets make inroads into the mainstream, crypto lender Figure is helping to turn them into viable collateral for credit.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Staff</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366771</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/figure-v2-2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/figure-v2-2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1079\" width=\"1918\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Charles Schwab Begins Offering Bitcoin, Ethereum Trading to US Users</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367768/charles-schwab-begins-bitcoin-ethereum-trading-us-users</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 16:31:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Charles Schwab started allowing select users to trade Bitcoin and Ethereum directly alongside their other investments.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367768</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-ethereum-decrypt-style-new-01-1-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-ethereum-decrypt-style-new-01-1-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bank of England Treating Stablecoins as &#39;New Form of Money&#39;, Says Exec</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367750/bank-england-treating-stablecoins-new-form-money-exec</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:57:32 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The U.K.’s central bank is “not picking winners” in the debate over tokenized deposits and stablecoins, Sasha Mills said Wednesday.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Stephen Graves</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367750</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bank-of-england-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bank-of-england-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Half of AI Health Advice Is Wrong—And Seems Just Right</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367689/half-ai-health-advice-wrong-seems-right</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 14:55:14 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A peer-reviewed audit in BMJ Open found that nearly 50% of health responses from five major AI chatbots were problematic, with fabricated sources and confident delivery.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367689</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Quantum Computing Threat &#39;Mostly a Coordination Issue&#39; for Bitcoin: Fireblocks CEO</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367714/quantum-computing-threat-coordination-issue-bitcoin-fireblocks-ceo</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 14:23:21 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Michael Shaulov argued that changing to a post-quantum cryptographic signature scheme is “not a technical challenge” for Bitcoin.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Stephen Graves</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367714</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/michael-shaulov-fireblocks-ceo-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/michael-shaulov-fireblocks-ceo-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: CPI Comes In Hot; Stocks, Crypto Shrug</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367731/morning-minute-cpi-comes-in-hot-stocks-crypto-shrug</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 11:43:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Hot CPI didn&#39;t stall markets for long, while the Clarity Act has already received 100 amendments ahead of tomorrow&#39;s markup.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367731</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-trading-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Hackers Insert Malware Into Mistral AI Software Download</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367683/hackers-insert-malware-mistral-ai</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 22:26:18 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Microsoft Threat Intelligence said attackers placed malicious code inside a Mistral AI software download distributed through a Python package.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367683</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Hacker-hack-decrypt-style-04-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Hacker-hack-decrypt-style-04-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>JPMorgan Files to Launch Tokenized Money Market Fund on Ethereum</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367664/jpmorgan-tokenized-money-market-fund-ethereum</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 21:31:14 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Global banking giant JPMorgan filed for a new tokenized money market fund that will initially run on the Ethereum network.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367664</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/JPMorgan-Chase-Co-building-in-New-York4-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/JPMorgan-Chase-Co-building-in-New-York4-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n  </channel>\n</rss>","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778823600895}}
