{"type":"message","id":"501127e6","parentId":"50a58cfd","timestamp":"2026-05-15T05:40:22.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the RSS feeds from multiple sources. Let me analyze the data:\n\nFrom CoinTelegraph:\n- \"US Senate Banking Committee votes to advance CLARITY Act\" - Thu, 14 May 2026 18:18:01 +0000\n- This appears to be a major regulatory story about crypto legislation\n\nFrom Decrypt:\n- \"Democrats Split on Clarity Act as Crypto Bill Passes Key Senate Committee Vote\" - Thu, 14 May 2026 16:51:58 +0000\n- Also about the CLARITY Act passing the Senate Banking Committee\n\nFrom Google News:\n- Multiple sources covering \"Bitcoin hits $82,000, Coinbase leads crypto stock gains as Clarity Act advances\"\n- \"US Senate committee advances crypto bill in milestone for digital assets\"\n- \"Crypto industry scores win as Clarity Act regulation bill clears Senate hurdle\"\n\nThis is clearly THE biggest story - the CLARITY Act passing the Senate Banking Committee with bipartisan support. This is a major milestone for US crypto regulation and is being covered by CoinTelegraph, Decrypt, CoinDesk, Reuters, CNBC, and many others.\n\nKey details from the feeds:\n- The CLARITY Act passed the Senate Banking Committee\n- It's a landmark crypto bill (H.R. 3633)\n- Vote was reportedly 15-9\n- It now moves to the Senate floor\n- Over 100 amendments were debated\n- Bitcoin price reacted positively (hit $82K)\n- Crypto stocks like Coinbase rallied\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Extract the specific URLs for this story from each feed\n2. Check the history database to make sure this hasn't been published before\n3. Fetch the full articles using trafilatura\n4. Return the aggregated JSON\n\nLet me identify the URLs first:\n- From CoinTelegraph: https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senate-banking-committee-advance-clarity-act\n- From Decrypt: https://decrypt.co/367871/democrats-split-clarity-act-crypto-bill-passes-senate-committee-vote\n \nI'll cross-reference the URLs with the history database to ensure this is a fresh story. After confirming, I'll extract the full article content using trafilatura. The goal is to compile a comprehensive, original report on this significant crypto regulatory milestone while avoiding duplicate publication. I'll verify the URL uniqueness and prepare for detailed content extraction."},{"type":"text","text":"Now I can see the cross-feed pattern. The **CLARITY Act passing the Senate Banking Committee** is clearly the biggest story—covered by CoinTelegraph, Decrypt, CoinDesk, Reuters, CNBC, Bloomberg, and Google News sources. This is major regulatory news with bipartisan implications for the US crypto industry.\n\nLet me extract the specific URLs and check the history database to ensure this hasn't been published before:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.exec:4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-researcher/skills/history/article_history.sh check \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senate-banking-committee-advance-clarity-act\"","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.exec:5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-researcher/skills/history/article_history.sh check \"https://decrypt.co/367871/democrats-split-clarity-act-crypto-bill-passes-senate-committee-vote\"","timeout":10}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"moonshotai.kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":106591,"output":702,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107293,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778823600903}}
